{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119155439587-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119155439\"/><p>圖95轟炸機進入台灣防空識別區。</p><p>台灣軍方周四（19日）表示，上午偵獲兩架俄羅斯圖95轟炸機，由台灣南面進入防空識別區，航經東部空域後於基隆東北面脫離。台軍運用聯合情監偵手段，全程掌握相關動態、適切應處。兩架圖95轟炸機，日前沿途經過南韓防空識別區、日本領空及台灣防空識別區後，抵達越南金蘭灣。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:03:51.311337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:54:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:52.155122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:16.386276+00:00","content_hash":"9da0ce9df456809d8766a5e701d45089fb851782039be996289224cb81a198c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}